[{"id":"fm-core1-1.49-q1","number":1,"question":"<p>Show that</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"3\\left(3^{k-1}+\\frac12\\right)-1=3^k+\\frac12\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"3(2^k+3^k)-2^k=2^{k+1}+3^{k+1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle\\frac{\\frac3{3k-1}}{1+\\frac3{3k-1}}=\\frac3{3(k+1)-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li><li><p><span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\frac12(k^2-5k+12)+k-2=\\frac12((k+1)^2-5(k+1)+12)\" data-display=\"false\"></span></p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"3\\left(3^{k-1}+\\frac12\\right)-1=3\\times3^{k-1}+\\frac32-1=3^1\\times3^{k-1}+\\frac12=3^k+\\frac12\\text{ as req.}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"3(2^k+3^k)-2^k=3\\times2^k+3\\times3^k-2^k=2^1\\times2^k+3^1\\times3^k=2^{k+1}+3^{k+1}\\text{ as req.}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac{\\frac3{3k-1}}{1+\\frac3{3k-1}}=\\frac3{3k-1+3}=\\frac3{3k+2}=\\frac3{3(k+1)-1}\\text{ as req.}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"\\frac12(k^2-5k+12)+k-2=\\frac12(k^2-5k+12+2k-4)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac12(k^2-3k+8)=\\frac12((k+1)^2-5k+7)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac12((k+1)^2-5(k+1)+12)\\text{ as req.}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.49-q2","number":2,"question":"<p>Given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_1=8\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_{n+1}=u_n-3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, prove that for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_n=11-3n\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_1=11-3\\times1=8\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_k=11-3k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"u_{k+1}=u_k-3=11-3k-3=11-3(k+1),\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_n=11-3n\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.49-q3","number":3,"question":"<p>Given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_1=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_{n+1}=2u_n-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, prove by mathematical induction for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\" data-display=\"false\"></span> that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_n=2^{n-1}+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_1=2^{1-1}+1=1+1=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_k=2^{k-1}+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"u_{k+1}=2u_k-1=2(2^{k-1}+1)-1=2\\times2^{k-1}+2-1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=2^1\\times2^{k-1}+2-1=2^k+1=2^{(k+1)-1}+1,\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_n=2^{n-1}+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.49-q4","number":4,"question":"<p>Given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_1=8\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_{n+1}=4u_n+3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, prove that for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_n=9\\times4^{n-1}-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_1=9\\times4^{1-1}-1=9-1=8\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_k=9\\times4^{k-1}-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"u_{k+1}=4u_k+3=4(9\\times4^{k-1}-1)+3\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=9\\times4^1\\times4^{k-1}-4+3=9\\times4^k-1=9\\times4^{(k+1)-1}-1,\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_n=9\\times4^{n-1}-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.49-q5","number":5,"question":"<p>Given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_1=4\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_{n+1}=3u_n-1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, prove by mathematical induction for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_n=\\frac16(7\\times3^n+3)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_1=\\frac16(7\\times3^1+3)=\\frac16(21+3)=4\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_k=\\frac16(7\\times3^k+3)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"u_{k+1}=3u_k-1=3\\left[\\frac16(7\\times3^k+3)\\right]-1\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac16(7\\times3^1\\times3^k+9)-1=\\frac16(7\\times3^1\\times3^k+9-6)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac16(7\\times3^{k+1}+3),\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_n=\\frac16(7\\times3^n+3)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.49-q6","number":6,"question":"<p>Given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_1=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_{n+1}=8u_n+5\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, prove that for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_n=\\frac{19\\times8^n-40}{56}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_1=\\frac{19\\times8-40}{56}=\\frac{112}{56}=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_k=\\frac{19\\times8^k-40}{56}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"u_{k+1}=8u_k+5=8\\left(\\frac{19\\times8^k-40}{56}\\right)+5\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac{19\\times8\\times8^k-320}{56}+\\frac{280}{56}=\\frac{19\\times8^1\\times8^k-40}{56}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac{19\\times8^{k+1}-40}{56},\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_n=\\frac{19\\times8^n-40}{56}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.49-q7","number":7,"question":"<p>Given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_1=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_{n+1}=u_n+3n+5\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, prove by mathematical induction for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\in\\mathbb N\" data-display=\"false\"></span> that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_n=\\frac12(3n^2+7n-6)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_1=\\frac12(3+7-6)=\\frac12\\times4=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_k=\\frac12(3k^2+7k-6)\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"u_{k+1}=u_k+3k+5=\\frac12(3k^2+7k-6)+3k+5\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac12(3k^2+7k-6+6k+10)=\\frac12(3k^2+13k+4)\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac12(3(k+1)^2+7k+1)=\\frac12(3(k+1)^2+7(k+1)-6),\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_n=\\frac12(3n^2+7n-6)\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.49-q8","number":8,"question":"<p>Given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_1=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle u_{n+1}=\\frac{u_n}{1+u_n}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, prove that for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_n=\\frac1n\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_1=\\frac11=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_k=\\frac1k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"u_{k+1}=\\frac{u_k}{1+u_k}=\\frac{\\frac1k}{1+\\frac1k}=\\frac1{k+1},\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_n=\\frac1n\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.49-q9","number":9,"question":"<p>Given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_1=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle u_{n+1}=\\frac{2u_n+1}{u_n+2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, prove that for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_n=\\frac{3^n+1}{3^n-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_1=\\frac{3^1+1}{3^1-1}=\\frac42=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_k=\\frac{3^k+1}{3^k-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"u_{k+1}=\\frac{2u_k+1}{u_k+2}=\\frac{2(\\frac{3^k+1}{3^k-1})+1}{(\\frac{3^k+1}{3^k-1})+2}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac{2(3^k+1)+3^k-1}{3^k+1+2(3^k-1)}=\\frac{2\\times3^k+2+3^k-1}{3^k+1+2\\times3^k-2}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac{3\\times3^k+1}{3\\times3^k-1}=\\frac{3^{k+1}+1}{3^{k+1}-1},\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_n=\\frac{3^n+1}{3^n-1}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.49-q10","number":10,"question":"<p>A sequence <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"z_1,z_2,z_3,\\ldots,z_n\" data-display=\"false\"></span> of complex numbers is defined recursively as follows: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"z_1=1+i\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"z_{n+1}=(1+i)z_n+(1-i)^n\" data-display=\"false\"></span> for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"z_2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"z_3\" data-display=\"false\"></span> expressing your answers in the form <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a+bi\" data-display=\"false\"></span> where <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"b\" data-display=\"false\"></span> are real numbers.</p></li><li><p>Prove by mathematical induction that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"z_n=\\frac12(1+i)^n+\\frac i2(1-i)^n\" data-display=\"false\"></span> for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"z_2=(1+i)z_1+(1-i)^1=(1+i)(1+i)+(1-i)=1+2i-1+1-i=1+i.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"z_3=(1+i)z_2+(1-i)^2=(1+i)(1+i)+(1-i)^2=2i+(1-2i-1)=0.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"z_1=\\frac12(1+i)^1+\\frac i2(1-i)^1=\\frac12+\\frac12i+\\frac12i+\\frac12=1+i,\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"z_k=\\frac12(1+i)^k+\\frac i2(1-i)^k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"z_{k+1}=(1+i)z_k+(1-i)^k\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=(1+i)\\left[\\frac12(1+i)^k+\\frac i2(1-i)^k\\right]+(1-i)^k\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac12(1+i)^{k+1}+\\frac i2(1+i)(1-i)^k+(1-i)^k\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac12(1+i)^{k+1}+\\frac i2(1-i)^k[(1+i)+\\frac2i]\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac12(1+i)^{k+1}+\\frac i2(1-i)^k[1-i]\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac12(1+i)^{k+1}+\\frac i2(1-i)^{k+1},\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"z_n=\\frac12(1+i)^n+\\frac i2(1-i)^n\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.49-q11","number":11,"question":"<p>A sequence <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_1,u_2,u_3,\\ldots,u_n\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is defined by the recurrence relation <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_1=3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"\\displaystyle u_{n+1}=\\frac{u_n}{2+u_n}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Find <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_2,u_3\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>Find the first 4 terms of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"2^{n+1}-3\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>Suggest an expression for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_n\" data-display=\"false\"></span> in terms of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>Prove by mathematical induction that your expression for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_n\" data-display=\"false\"></span> is correct.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"u_2=\\frac{u_1}{2+u_1}=\\frac3{2+3}=\\frac35\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"u_3=\\frac{u_2}{2+u_2}=\\frac{\\frac35}{2+\\frac35}=\\frac3{13}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"u_4=\\frac{u_3}{2+u_3}=\\frac{\\frac3{13}}{2+\\frac3{13}}=\\frac3{29}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"2^{1+1}-3=1\\qquad2^{2+1}-3=5\\qquad2^{3+1}-3=13\\qquad2^{4+1}-3=29.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">c)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"u_n=\\frac3{2^{n+1}-3}.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">d)</h3><p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_1=\\frac3{2^{1+1}-3}=\\frac3{4-3}=3\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_k=\\frac3{2^{k+1}-3}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"u_{k+1}=\\frac{u_k}{2+u_k}=\\frac{\\frac3{2^{k+1}-3}}{2+\\frac3{2^{k+1}-3}}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac3{2(2^{k+1}-3)+3}=\\frac3{2\\times2^{k+1}-6+3}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=\\frac3{2^1\\times2^{k+1}-3}=\\frac3{2^{k+2}-3}=\\frac3{2^{(k+1)+1}-3},\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_n=\\frac3{2^{k+1}-3}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.49-q12","number":12,"question":"<p>Given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_1=q\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_{n+1}=u_n+a\" data-display=\"false\"></span> for constants <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"q\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"a\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, prove by mathematical induction for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_n=q+(n-1)a\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","steps":["<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_1=q+(1-1)a=q\" data-display=\"false\"></span> so true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_k=q+(k-1)a\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"u_{k+1}=u_k+a=q+(k-1)a+a=q+ka\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=q+(k+1-1)a,\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_n=q+(n-1)a\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]},{"id":"fm-core1-1.49-q13","number":13,"question":"<p>Given that <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_1=5\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_2=13\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_{n+2}=3u_{n+1}-2u_n\" data-display=\"false\"></span>,</p><ol class=\"parts\" start=\"1\"><li><p>Write down the values of <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_3\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_4\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li><li><p>Prove that for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_n=-3+2^{n+2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p></li></ol>","steps":["<h3 class=\"part-label\">a)</h3><span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"u_3=3u_2-2u_1=3\\times13-2\\times5=29.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"u_4=3u_3-2u_2=3\\times29-2\\times13=61.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<h3 class=\"part-label\">b)</h3><p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span> and <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"u_1=-3+2^{1+2}=-3+8=5\\text{ so true for }n=1,\\qquad u_2=-3+2^{2+2}=13\\text{ so true for }n=2.\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_k=-3+2^{k+2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Assume true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>: <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_{k+1}=-3+2^{k+3}\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>","<p>Prove true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+2\" data-display=\"false\"></span>:</p>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"u_{k+2}=3u_{k+1}-2u_k=3(-3+2^{k+3})-2(-3+2^{k+2})\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=-9+3\\times2^{k+3}+6-2\\times2^{k+2}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=-3+6\\times2^{k+2}-2\\times2^{k+2}=-3+4\\times2^{k+2}\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<span class=\"equation\" data-math=\"=-3+2^{k+4}=-3+2^{(k+2)+2},\" data-display=\"true\"></span>","<p>which is <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"u_n=-3+2^{n+2}\" data-display=\"false\"></span> with <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"k+2\" data-display=\"false\"></span> substituted in.</p>","<p>As the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, and if the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k\" data-display=\"false\"></span> then the statement is true for <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n=k+1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>, so the statement is true for all integers <span class=\"inline-math\" data-math=\"n\\ge1\" data-display=\"false\"></span>.</p>"]}]